cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MultimodalPhysioKit in academic work, please cite the software and the relevant methodological publications listed in this file."
title: "MultimodalPhysioKit"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Luzzani"
    given-names: "Gabriele"
license: "LGPL-3.0-or-later"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Gabbert97/MultimodalPhysioKit"
abstract: >
  Reusable MATLAB and Python software for multimodal physiological
  signal processing, including a bundled mathematically generated fixture.
  Research datasets and private validation recordings are not
  distributed with the software.
keywords:
  - physiological signals
  - multimodal analysis
  - signal processing
  - MATLAB
  - Python
